## Acceptance Criteria

- [x] All six entities exist with the fields named in the data-model spec
- [x] Key relationships hold: Finding->Risk->BusinessProcess->FinancialImpact (foundation)
- [x] Key relationships hold: BusinessProcess->Application->Asset
- [x] Key relationships hold: Asset->DataObject
- [x] Migrations run cleanly against the existing PostgreSQL schema without breaking the 5 current tables
- [x] All tables properly reference orgs(id) with ON DELETE CASCADE
- [x] JSONB columns for array relationships
- [x] CHECK constraints for enum-like fields
- [x] Indexes for performance optimization

